{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"中后段多次把怀念转向遇到困难时无人帮衬、自己能否撑住以及眼下生活能否安稳，容易将主线带向独自生活的承受力焦虑。\",\n    \"S09把想回去的原因部分解释为难受时想有人陪，容易将对旧日归属的怀念缩窄为即时的陪伴需求。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"后半段较集中于能否重新获得真实亲近、再次被当作自己人的归属，旧日生活本身的怀念相对退居背景。\",\n    \"结尾较快将未来是否有人接纳转化为珍惜新关系或独自好好生活，反复拉扯的余韵略有减弱。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y更持续地围绕旧日生活中的归属感展开，并让对亲近的怀念与不愿再忍受委屈、坚持维护尊严相互牵动。X虽然也包含这两方面，但中后段更明显地转向独自应对困难的焦虑，因而部分偏离了Center的核心拉扯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "321f7e75-8dd5-40a9-a3ab-3dd568e5211b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075623015973Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:56:52.168978+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e6c4b3c5bec5fd5c8a3a5a8635d2f63526378164e6141ce6a455c353934ec4a9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py